{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 36, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Ps36 (28 chars). Wicked's corrupt heart (v1-4) vs God's abundant chesed (v5-9). chesed x3 (v5,7,10), two lev (wicked's heart where pesha speaks v1 / upright of heart v10), pachad no-fear-of-God, chasah refuge under wings, eden delights. (v9 fountain-of-life/light noted; no flagged span.) Poetic ledger; span-id pairs.",
  "spans": {
    "277492": {"gloss":"Transgression v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"transgression (pesha - speaks to the wicked)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (in whose heart it speaks)","from":277492,"to":277494,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"speak (as an oracle)","to":277492,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the wicked's heart","from":277492,"to":277496,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"deep in his heart","to":277492,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'TRANSGRESSION (pesha) speaks to the wicked deep in his heart' — sin personified as an oracle within; pesha here a voice in the heart (like a false prophecy), the inner dictation of rebellion that leaves no room for the fear of God"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277494": {"gloss":"wicked v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wicked (rasha)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked man","to":277494,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"in whose heart transgression speaks","from":277494,"to":277492,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'to the WICKED (rasha)' — the man ruled by sin's inner voice; rasha (recurs v11) the wicked whose heart harbours transgression's oracle, no fear of God before his eyes"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277496": {"gloss":"heart v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - deep in his heart)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":277496,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":277496,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"where transgression speaks","from":277496,"to":277492,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'deep in his HEART (lev)' — the wicked's heart as sin's inner sanctum; lev here the corrupt seat where transgression whispers — the dark counterpart to v10's 'upright of heart', the two hearts of the psalm"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277498": {"gloss":"fear v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"fear / dread (pachad - no fear of God)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (lacking it)","to":277498,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"absent ('there is NO fear of God before his eyes')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'there is no FEAR (pachad) of God before his eyes' — the root of the wickedness; pachad absent (cf Ps34's fear of the LORD as the fount of good) — the missing dread of God that lets transgression rule the heart"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277520": {"gloss":"flatters v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"flatter / deceive (chalak)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":277520,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"flatter (himself)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"himself (in his own eyes)","to":277520,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with his iniquity unfound","from":277520,"to":277522,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he FLATTERS (chalak) himself in his own eyes' — self-deception; chalak = to be smooth/flatter, the wicked lying to himself that his iniquity will not be found out and hated"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277522": {"gloss":"iniquity v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity (avon)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":277522,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with being hated","from":277522,"to":277524,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'that his INIQUITY (avon) cannot be found out and hated' — the guilt he imagines hidden; avon (recurs Ps32) the wicked's iniquity he flatters himself will escape detection"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277524": {"gloss":"hated v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hate (sane - iniquity found out and hated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God/others (would hate it)","to":277524,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hate"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"his iniquity","from":277524,"to":277522,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the iniquity","from":277524,"to":277522,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'found out and HATED (sane)' — the hatred his iniquity deserves; sane here the just abhorrence of sin the wicked deludes himself he will escape"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277527": {"gloss":"trouble v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity / trouble (aven - words of his mouth)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (his words)","to":277527,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with deceit","from":277527,"to":277528,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'The words of his mouth are TROUBLE (aven) and deceit' — his speech itself iniquity; aven (recurs Ps28:3) the mischief his mouth pours out, joined with deceit"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277528": {"gloss":"deceit v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"deceit (mirmah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":277528,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with trouble","from":277528,"to":277527,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'trouble and DECEIT (mirmah)' — the deceit filling his speech; mirmah (recurs Ps35:20) the guile of the wicked who has ceased to act wisely"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277530": {"gloss":"wisely v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"act wisely (sakal, ceased)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (ceased to)","to":277530,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"act wisely (ceased)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"ceased ('he has CEASED to act wisely and do good')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he has ceased to act WISELY (sakal) and do good' — abandoned wisdom and goodness; sakal (as Ps32:8, there God's instruction) here the wisdom the wicked has forsaken, the collapse of moral discernment"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277532": {"gloss":"plots v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"plot / devise (chashab)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":277532,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"plot"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"trouble","from":277532,"to":277533,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"on his bed","to":277532,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'He PLOTS (chashab) trouble while on his bed' — scheming even in rest; chashab (recurs Ps35:4,20) the wicked's mind devising mischief in the night, the sleepless machinery of malice"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277533": {"gloss":"trouble v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity / trouble (aven - plots trouble)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":277533,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the thing plotted","from":277533,"to":277532,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'plots TROUBLE (aven)' — the mischief he devises; aven (recurs v3) the iniquity plotted on the bed, the object of his nocturnal scheming"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277540": {"gloss":"good v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"good (tov - a way not good)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (sets himself in a not-good way)","to":277540,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with not rejecting evil","from":277540,"to":277543,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"negated ('a way that is NOT good')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he sets himself in a way that is not GOOD (tov)' — deliberate commitment to evil; tov negated, the wicked fixing himself in a bad path, refusing the good"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277543": {"gloss":"evil v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"evil (ra - does not reject evil)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (does not reject it)","to":277543,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the not-good way","from":277543,"to":277540,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"not-rejected ('he does NOT reject evil')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he does not reject EVIL (ra)' — the embrace of evil; ra unrejected, the wicked's refusal to spurn what is evil, the climax of the portrait of corruption (v1-4)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277544": {"gloss":"steadfast love v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"steadfast love (chesed - extends to the heavens)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":277544,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"to the heavens","to":277544,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with faithfulness","from":277544,"to":277548,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Your CHESED (steadfast love), O LORD, extends to the heavens' — love of cosmic scope; chesed (first of three, v5,7,10) reaching to the skies, the sudden turn from the wicked's narrow heart to God's boundless love"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277548": {"gloss":"faithfulness v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"faithfulness (emunah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":277548,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"to the clouds","to":277548,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with steadfast love","from":277548,"to":277544,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'your FAITHFULNESS (emunah) to the clouds' — reliability reaching the skies; emunah (recurs Ps33:4) God's faithfulness paired with chesed, both immeasurable"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277550": {"gloss":"righteousness v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"righteousness (tsedaqah - like the mountains)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":277550,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"like the mountains of God","to":277550,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Your RIGHTEOUSNESS (tsedaqah) is like the mountains of God' — justice as vast and firm as mountains; tsedaqah (first of two, v6,10) God's unshakeable rightness, his judgements deep as the great deep"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277558": {"gloss":"save v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"save (yasha - man and beast you save)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":277558,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"save"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"man and beast","to":277558,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'man and beast you SAVE (yasha), O LORD' — God's preserving care over all creatures; yasha here the salvation extending even to the animals, the breadth of divine goodness"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277562": {"gloss":"steadfast love v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"steadfast love (chesed - how precious)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":277562,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the children of mankind","from":277562,"to":277566,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"precious","to":277562,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"under which they take refuge","from":277562,"to":277566,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'How precious is your CHESED (steadfast love), O God!' — love treasured; chesed (second of three) so precious that mankind takes refuge in the shadow of God's wings, the ground of shelter"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277566": {"gloss":"take refuge v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"take refuge (chasah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the children of mankind","to":277566,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"take refuge"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the shadow of God's wings","to":277566,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"drawn by the precious chesed","from":277566,"to":277562,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'take REFUGE (chasah) in the shadow of your wings' — sheltering under God's love; chasah (recurs Ps34:8) the refuge of mankind under the wings, feasting on the abundance of God's house"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277576": {"gloss":"delights v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"delights (eden - river of your delights)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (his delights)","to":277576,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"those who take refuge (given drink)","to":277576,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'you give them drink from the river of your DELIGHTS (eden)' — God's abundant joys; eden (the word of Eden = delight/pleasure) the river of pleasure from which the sheltered drink, the fountain of life and light (v9)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277502": {"gloss":"steadfast love v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"steadfast love (chesed - continue it)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (asked to continue it)","to":277502,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"those who know God","from":277502,"to":277503,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with righteousness to the upright","from":277502,"to":277504,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'continue your CHESED (steadfast love) to those who know you' — the prayer for love's continuance; chesed (third of three, v5,7,10) asked to be prolonged toward the God-knowers and the upright of heart"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277503": {"gloss":"know v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"know (yada - those who know you)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"those who know God","to":277503,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"know"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God","to":277503,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"recipients of continued chesed","from":277503,"to":277502,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'to those who KNOW (yada) you' — the God-knowers as recipients of love; yada here relational knowledge of God, paralleled with the upright of heart"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277504": {"gloss":"righteousness v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"righteousness (tsedaqah - to the upright)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (his righteousness)","to":277504,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the upright of heart","from":277504,"to":277505,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with chesed to God-knowers","from":277504,"to":277502,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and your RIGHTEOUSNESS (tsedaqah) to the upright of heart!' — justice for the upright; tsedaqah (second of two, v6,10) God's saving righteousness sought for the straight-hearted"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277505": {"gloss":"upright v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"upright (yashar - of heart)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the upright of heart","from":277505,"to":277506,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"describes the heart","from":277505,"to":277506,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'to the UPRIGHT (yashar) of heart' — the straight-hearted as recipients; yashar (recurs Ps33:1) the uprightness of the heart that receives God's righteousness — the bright counterpart to v1's corrupt heart"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277506": {"gloss":"heart v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - upright of heart)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":277506,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the upright","to":277506,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the seat of uprightness","from":277506,"to":277505,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the upright of HEART (lev)' — the good heart of the psalm; lev here the straight heart of God's people, the deliberate contrast to v1's heart where transgression speaks — the two hearts framing the psalm"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277508": {"gloss":"arrogance v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"pride / arrogance (gaavah - foot of arrogance)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the arrogant (their foot)","to":277508,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David (deprecated)","to":277508,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the hand of the wicked","from":277508,"to":277511,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"deprecated ('Let NOT the foot of arrogance come upon me')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Let not the foot of ARROGANCE (gaavah) come upon me' — the plea against the proud; gaavah (recurs Ps31:18,23) the arrogance whose trampling foot David asks God to keep away"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277511": {"gloss":"wicked v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wicked (rasha)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (their hand)","to":277511,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"drive away","to":277511,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David (deprecated)","to":277511,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the foot of arrogance","from":277511,"to":277508,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"deprecated ('nor the hand of the WICKED drive me away')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'nor the hand of the WICKED (rasha) drive me away' — the plea against the wicked's power; rasha (recurs v1) the evildoer whose driving hand David asks God to restrain — 'there the evildoers lie fallen' (v12)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]}
